## ✅ Few-Shot Examples

### Example 1 — EmailAddress

* **Rationale:** Contact PII, RFC-5322-ish validation, partial mask

```
- id: sem://contact/EmailAddress
  name: EmailAddress
  category: Contact
  description: RFC-compliant electronic mail address for a person or role.
  aliases: [email, e-mail, email_address, login_email]
  detection:
    regexes: ['^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$']
    keywords: [email, e-mail, mail]
  constraints:
    datatype: string
    format: rfc5322
    nullability: Allowed
  governance:
    sensitivity: Restricted
    masking_policy: SHOW_FIRST1_LAST1
    qa_rules: [qa://regex_match, qa://null_rate<=0.02]
  lineage_role: DimAttr
  allowed_ops: [profile, hash, tokenize, no-free-text-search]
  examples: ["alex.smith@example.com", "ops-alerts@corp.io"]
  anti_examples: ["alex at example dot com", "http://example.com"]
  version: 1.0.0
  status: Approved
```

### Example 2 — MonetaryAmount

* **Rationale:** Financial numeric, unit via ISO 4217, additive

```
- id: sem://finance/MonetaryAmount
  name: MonetaryAmount
  category: Financial
  description: Currency-denominated numeric amount; unit specified separately using ISO 4217.
  aliases: [amount, price, value, cost, revenue_amount]
  detection:
    regexes: ['^-?\\d+(\\.\\d{1,4})?$']
    keywords: [amount, price, revenue, cost, spend]
  constraints:
    datatype: decimal(18,4)
    units: ISO4217
    nullability: Allowed
    value_range:
      min: -100000000000
      max:  100000000000
  governance:
    sensitivity: Internal
    masking_policy: NONE
    qa_rules: [qa://valid_decimal, qa://range_check]
  lineage_role: Measure
  allowed_ops: [sum, avg, pct_change]
  examples: ["12.34", "0", "-99.5000"]
  anti_examples: ["USD 12.34", "twelve"]
  version: 1.0.0
  status: Approved
```

### Example 3 — CustomerID (Identifier)

* **Rationale:** High-uniqueness join key, hashed masking

```
- id: sem://id/CustomerID
  name: CustomerID
  category: Identifier
  description: Stable surrogate key that uniquely identifies a customer entity.
  aliases: [customer_id, cust_id, cid]
  detection:
    regexes: ['^[A-Z0-9]{10,32}$']
    keywords: [customerid, cid, custid]
    statistical:
      uniqueness_ratio_min: 0.99
      avg_length_min: 10
  constraints:
    datatype: string
    nullability: NotAllowed
  governance:
    sensitivity: Internal
    masking_policy: HASH
    qa_rules: [qa://unique, qa://not_null, qa://regex_match]
  lineage_role: JoinKey
  allowed_ops: [join_equality, group_by]
  examples: ["A9F3K2L8Q1", "00C1X9Z7T4"]
  anti_examples: ["123", "john@example.com"]
  version: 1.0.0
  status: Approved
```

