## Optional Categories to use
* **Contact/PII:** PhoneNumber, PostalAddress (Struct), PersonName (Struct), DateOfBirth
* **Geo:** CountryCode(ISO-3166-1-alpha2), PostalCode(country-scoped), Latitude, Longitude
* **Temporal:** Date, DateTimeUTC(iso8601), YearMonth, EpochMillis
* **Behavioral:** URL, ReferrerURL, UserAgent, EventName, EventTimestamp
* **Commerce/Finance:** SKU, Quantity, UnitPrice, DiscountPercent, TaxRatePercent, IBAN, CardPAN(masked)
* **Technical:** JSONBlob, Enum:<X>, CategoryCode(list-backed)
* **Structs:** Address{StreetLine1, StreetLine2?, City, State, PostalCode, CountryCode}, Name{First,Middle?,Last}

